# the argument of aquinas-third-way.md by rule (phil/skeleton): connectives from the parse, an atom to each clause
logic	s5
atom	taken_possibility_necessity(x)	x: is taken from possibility and necessity
atom	run	runs thus
atom	found_generat_corrupt	they are found to be generated and to corrupt
atom	find_nature_thing	we find in nature things that are possible to be and not to be
atom	possible	and consequently they are possible to be and not to be
atom	impossible_alway_exist	but it is impossible for these always to exist for that which is possible not to be at some time is not
