atom	time(x)	x: then at one time there could have been
atom	true	this were true
atom	now_even_now(x)	x: Now even now there would be because that which does not exist only begins to exist by something already existing
atom	time_existence_impossible	if at one time nothing was in existence it would have been impossible for anything to have begun to exist
atom	even_now_existence(x)	x: thus even now would be in existence - - which is absurd
atom	merely_possible(x)	x: are merely possible
atom	being(x)	x: beings
atom	exist_someth_existence	there exist something the existence of which is necessary
atom	necessity_cau(x)	x: but either has its necessity caused by another or not
atom	necessary_thing(x)	x: necessary thing
atom	now_impossible_go	Now it is impossible to go on to infinity in necessary things which have their necessity caused by another as has been already proved in regard to efficient causes
